### All pricing rules (the seeded "Weekend +20%" is always there)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/pricing-rules
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

### A theater-specific Friday-night surcharge (beats city and global rules)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/pricing-rules
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

{"name": "Friday nights", "scopeType": "THEATER", "scopeId": {{theaterId}}, "daysOfWeek": [5],
 "adjustmentType": "FLAT", "adjustmentValue": 5000}

> {% client.global.set("ruleId", response.body.id); %}

### Pause it
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/pricing-rules/{{ruleId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

{"name": "Friday nights", "scopeType": "THEATER", "scopeId": {{theaterId}}, "daysOfWeek": [5],
 "adjustmentType": "FLAT", "adjustmentValue": 5000, "active": false}

### Delete it
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/pricing-rules/{{ruleId}}
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN
